            "review_title": "Review at Pi Cha - Quán Ăn Thái",
            "review_text": "Vacation51254484788\n1 contribution\n0\nREVIEW PICHA shop in the most TRUE way!!!\nApr 2024 • Couples\n- The restaurant space is airy and clean.\n-. The food is authentically Thai. If you want spicy or not spicy food, just let the owner know. My favorite dish is Shrimp Pad Thai, Raw Shrimp with Papaya Salad. Every dish is rich in flavor and the food is fresh. If you come, remember to try some of the most delicious drinks like Thai tea or healthy drink.\n- The owners are so cute and enthusiastic.\n- When I went, I won a holiday and got a free dessert. Birthday parties also get a 5% discount. Too enthusiastic and cute. I will come to visit!!!!\n- The minus point of the shop is that there are still many mosquitoes, so everyone remember to tell the owner to burn mosquito incense.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten April 12, 2024",
